  "description": "Audit trail for an OLAX service's EF Core DbContext (PostgreSQL): every insert, update, soft delete and restore is written in the same transaction, with actor, trace and cause; entries are sealed into a SHA-256 hash chain; query and verify endpoints included. Registers everything with AddOlaxAuditing<TDbContext>().",
