  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Olax.Auditing.Messaging forwards sealed entries to Audit.API through the outbox (AddOlaxAuditForwarding), in the sealing transaction; IAuditSealListener hook. 1.0.0: first release. Per-service audit trail on EF Core (PostgreSQL) with a hash chain from day one, business events, query endpoints, and an operation context (trace, actor, causation) shared with Olax.Messaging. See the README for setup.",
